<title>HONG KONG: GMAC launches US$500 mln Euro-Asian bond.</title>
<headline>GMAC launches US$500 mln Euro-Asian bond.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by joint lead manager HSBC Markets on Wednesday.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GENERAL MOTORS ACCEPTANCE CORP</p>
<p> AMT   $500 MLN	COUPON     **	   MATURITY  10.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE  EURO ASIAN    SPREAD     40 BP**    PAY DATE  10.JUL.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A3	 ISS PRICE  **	   LAUNCH    25.JUN.97</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A-	 REOFFER    **	   FULL FEES 1-7/8</p>
<p> LISTING    LON/HK   DENOMS (K) --</p>
<p> SALE LIMITS US (NOT 144A)/UK/HK</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.30     SELL CONC  1.575	PAY FREQ    ANNUALLY</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	CRS DEFLT  YES	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NY	 HOME CTRY  US</p>
<p> LEADS	HSBC MARKETS AND PARIBAS</p>
<p>NOTES - ** TO BE PRICED AT OR BEFORE 11.30 LONDON TIME TO YIELD</p>
<p>		40 BASIS POINTS OVER THE WHEN-ISSUED FIVE-YEAR U.S.</p>
<p>		TREASURY BOND. EUROCLEAR/CEDEL CLEARING.</p>
<p>		A GROUP IS BEING FORMED.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6371</p>
</text>
